    "turn_text": "Hello, everybody. And welcome to a Wispolitics Capital Chats podcast brought to you by Spectrum. I'm Kate Morton, a reporter with wispolitics.com here with my colleague, Adam, to talk about an interview he did with US rep Mike Gallagher. So Adam, what did you guys talk about?",
