  {
    "episode_id": 81286,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81286.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "Sure. Yeah. Interesting. So I want to go back to that, that select committee on the Chinese Communist Party. That's a, that's a big move for you this year. So what are your, like, what are your top priorities for that committee? And I've also heard some people voice concerns that maybe this committee could, you know, break into a little bit of borderline racism. Are you going to try to, how are you going to try to avoid that? And what are the priorities for this committee?",
